src/interfaces/native-text.js and src/native-topic-help.js. Interface sources
retain the upstream licenses noted above; ros2cli/ros2topic help is from
Open Source Robotics Foundation ROS 2 packages (Apache License 2.0).

The native installation reference captures locally installed ROS 2 Jazzy and Graphviz files.
Original source headers and package license/copyright files are retained in the reference.
Native binary payloads are represented by size/hash metadata, not redistributed binaries.
Runtime-backed files retain the lab implementations; reference presence does not imply execution support.
